{{> header title="Your password has been reset" subtitle="The change is already in effect" }}

<p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Your password was reset on <strong>{{currentDate}}</strong>. You can sign in with
    it now.</p>

<div class="security-note"
    style="background:#FBF7F0; border-left:3px solid #C9A227; padding:16px 18px; margin:22px 0; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px;">If this was not you, write to
        <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#8A5A3B;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
        straight away &mdash; someone else may have access to your account, and we can
        lock it while we look.</p>
</div>

<div class="divider" style="height:1px; line-height:1px; font-size:0; background:#EDE7E0; margin:28px 0;">&nbsp;</div>

<h3 style="color:#2C1810; margin:0 0 12px;">Worth doing once</h3>
<ul style="margin:0; padding-left:20px; color:#3F3A36;">
    <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">Use a password you have not used on another site.</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">Check your recent orders for anything you did not place.</li>
    <li>Sign out on any device you no longer use.</li>
</ul>

<p style="margin-top: 28px;">Thank you for keeping your account secure,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
